      {MINI.map(x => (
        <ProductCard name={x.p.name.replace(/’/g, "'")} image={x.p.image} price={x.p.price} rating={x.p.rating} reviews={x.p.reviews} badge={x.badge} specs={x.specs} pros={x.pros} cons={x.cons} verdict={x.verdict} outKey={'p-' + x.id} />
      ))}
    </div>

    <img class="rd-fig" src={figMini} alt="Mini fierastraie pe acumulator: Folixs, Herrgut, Kardett" width="1200" height="675" loading="lazy" />

    <h2 id="cablu">Drujbe electrice cu cablu</h2>
    <p>De 1800-1900 W si lame de 35-40 cm: putere multa, autonomie nelimitata si cel mai bun pret pe watt. Te tin legat de o priza, deci sunt facute pentru taiat lemn de foc gros la un punct fix in curte.</p>
    <div class="rd-grid">
      {CABLU.map(x => (
        <ProductCard name={x.p.name.replace(/’/g, "'")} image={x.p.image} price={x.p.price} rating={x.p.rating} reviews={x.p.reviews} badge={x.badge} specs={x.specs} pros={x.pros} cons={x.cons} verdict={x.verdict} outKey={'p-' + x.id} />
      ))}
    </div>

    <img class="rd-fig" src={figCablu} alt="Drujbe electrice cu cablu: Einhell, Heinner, Procraft, Bosch, Makita" width="1200" height="675" loading="lazy" />

    <h2 id="acu">Drujbe pe acumulator full-size</h2>
    <p>Aceeasi forma ca drujbele clasice, dar fara cablu: te lasa sa lucrezi oriunde, iar modelele de 36 V taie busteni grosi la fel ca cele de retea. Multe vin kit complet, cu acumulator si incarcator incluse.</p>
    <div class="rd-grid">
      {ACU.map(x => (
        <ProductCard name={x.p.name.replace(/’/g, "'")} image={x.p.image} price={x.p.price} rating={x.p.rating} reviews={x.p.reviews} badge={x.badge} specs={x.specs} pros={x.pros} cons={x.cons} verdict={x.verdict} outKey={'p-' + x.id} />
      ))}
    </div>

